#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""t2: BackOtter's Test2 words, run on the Mac (contract 1.7; rulings R10, R21, R27).

  t2 WORD [ARG...] [plan] [--json] [--hosts H,H] [--universe CELL,...]
        GateTest2 [ROUND] [LAYER...] [stale] [plan]       GateTest2All [ROUND] [plan]
        SticTest2 [ROUND] [GUEST...] [stale] [plan]       SticTest2All [ROUND] [plan]
        HoltTest2 [GUEST[+VARIANT]...] [stale] [plan] [+bigger] [+oneshot] [+degraded] [+img] [--holt-bin DIR]
        HoltTest2X [X...] for X in D A M U Z F C V BSD H I Obscure      HoltTest2All [plan]
        GuestTest2 [GUEST...] [stale] [plan]              GuestTest2All [plan]
        GuestTest2 update [GUEST...] [plan]               the real update round
        ImgTest2 [PLAT...] [release] [stale] [plan]       ImgTest2All [release] [plan]
        BkoTest2 [ROUND] [stale] [plan]                   SweepTest2 [ROUND] [plan]
        (--universe is test-only: it cuts the word's cells down to those named)
  t2 plan WORD [ARG...]                  the same as WORD ... plan
  t2 pull                                each host's ledger mirrored, then the wear join
  t2 ledger show [--cell C] [--last N] [--json]
  t2 explain CELL [--hosts H,H] [--round R]
                                         its inputs against its last PASS, group by group
  t2 copy [--hosts H,H] [--gc]           the private copy of this checkout on the hosts
  t2 resume RUN                          a run picked up again (R10); t2b-/t2w-: the composite
  t2 guest-lines RUN [--show [GUEST]] [--accept GUEST...|--accept-all]
                                         a GuestTest2 run's new log lines, and accepting them
  t2 guest-fingerprints [GUEST...] [--reproject]
                                         probe guests with no fingerprint at their generation
  t2 self-test                           tests/test_*.py, drive.py --self-test, the specs' checker,
                                         the fixtures' leak scan and the class table's check
  t2 ledger seed-current --family gate|stic|holt|guest|img [--perturb GROUP] [--cells C,...] [--age CELL=HOURS,...]
        [--round R] [--hosts H,H]        test only: synthetic PASS rows at the current keys
                                         (refused unless T2_MAC_ROOT is set and isn't the default)

--hosts H,H: of chopin, cinqcent, copland (default chopin,cinqcent; copland is known, not a
default host until HostTest2 and a representative per family pass there).
Roots: T2_MAC_ROOT (~/backotter-work/test2), T2_HOST_ROOT (/bkoscratch/test2), T2_COPY_ROOT
(~/backotter-work/t2/copy), BKO_GIT (~/git).  Exit 0: PASS, nothing due or a plan printed;
1: a FAIL or FLAKY-FAIL, a to-class cell, or a stop rule stopped the run; 2: refused; 3: an internal error.
"""

